{"claims":[{"excerpt":"De aanpak achter de POA-refunddienst","claim":"The piece presents the described approach as the approach behind the POA refund service, without explicitly claiming that it caused the service’s launch or results.","category":"interpretation","label":"F0 faithful","evidence":"My team and I built a digital and assisted digital service","narrative":"","narrativeRelation":"absent","origin":"none","explanation":"The source describes the team’s approach to building the service; the title does not assert a causal effect.","materiality":"Low; this is framing rather than a specific performance claim."},{"excerpt":"De POA-refunddienst werd na twaalf weken publiek gelanceerd.","claim":"The service was launched publicly after twelve weeks.","category":"chronology","label":"F1 minor immaterial imprecision","evidence":"We passed alpha and beta Service Standard assessments and launched to the public in only 12 weeks.","narrative":"Het POA-refundteam lanceerde de dienst na twaalf weken","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"propagated","explanation":"The source says the service launched in twelve weeks; “na twaalf weken” can imply it launched after that duration rather than within it. The narrative repeats this wording, while its context section more accurately says “binnen twaalf weken.” The source does not specify the duration’s starting point.","materiality":"Minor chronology nuance; it does not substantially change the reported timeframe."},{"excerpt":"Levering binnen de aanvankelijk gevraagde termijn van enkele weken werd niet haalbaar geacht als daarbij een kwalitatieve gebruikersdienst behouden moest blijven.","claim":"The team concluded that the initially requested delivery within a matter of weeks was not feasible while maintaining a quality service for users.","category":"certainty","label":"F0 faithful","evidence":"We were initially asked to deliver the service in a matter of weeks, which put huge pressure on everyone and we quickly discovered would not be possible if we wanted to create a quality service for our users.","narrative":"nadat levering binnen de aanvankelijk gevraagde termijn van enkele weken niet haalbaar werd geacht met behoud van een kwalitatieve gebruikersdienst","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"none","explanation":"This accurately preserves both the requested timeframe and the stated condition about service quality.","materiality":"Material context for the team’s reported time pressure, accurately represented."},{"excerpt":"Het POA-refundteam werkte eerst de ervaring voor aanvragers uit en bracht die naar alpha.","claim":"The team first focused on the applicant experience and took that work to the alpha assessment.","category":"chronology","label":"F0 faithful","evidence":"My team focused on the users applying for refunds first and this is what we took to the alpha assessment.","narrative":"eerst de aanvragerservaring uitwerken, later caseworkerwerk toevoegen","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"none","explanation":"The source says the team focused on applicants first and took that work to alpha; the Dutch phrasing summarizes this as developing the applicant experience.","materiality":"Central to the described order of work; supported by the source."},{"excerpt":"Plannen voor caseworkers kwamen later.","claim":"Plans for the caseworker user came later than the initial focus on applicants.","category":"chronology","label":"F0 faithful","evidence":"Plans for the caseworker user came later.","narrative":"later caseworkerwerk toevoegen","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"none","explanation":"This matches the source’s stated sequence.","materiality":"Central to the described order of work; supported by the source."},{"excerpt":"Tijdens de private beta wisselden tweewekelijkse sprints af tussen het aannemen van aanvragen en tijd besteden aan testen, onderzoek en verwerking.","claim":"During private beta, fortnightly sprints alternated between accepting applications and time spent on testing, research, and processing.","category":"technical","label":"F2 material incorrect, unsupported or misleading","evidence":"We achieved this by splitting our fortnightly sprints in two: testing, researching and accepting applications in the first week and then suspending submissions to concentrate on testing, researching and processing applications the second.","narrative":"Tijdens de private beta wisselden tweewekelijkse sprints af tussen aanvragen aannemen en tijd besteden aan testen, onderzoek en verwerking. In de eerste week testte en onderzocht het team en nam het aanvragen aan; in de tweede week werden inzendingen gepauzeerd voor testen, onderzoek en verwerking.","narrativeRelation":"differs","origin":"new_distortion","explanation":"The source describes each fortnightly sprint as split into two weeks: the team accepted applications while also testing and researching in week one, then suspended submissions while testing, researching, and processing in week two. The piece’s phrasing instead presents acceptance and the combined testing/research/processing work as alternating activities, obscuring the overlap and the specific pause in submissions.","materiality":"Material because the sprint cadence and allocation of work are a central part of the described approach."},{"excerpt":"Zo combineerde de beschreven werkwijze een eerste focus op aanvragers met expliciet gereserveerde tijd voor onderzoek en testen.","claim":"The described approach combined an initial focus on applicants with explicitly allocated time for research and testing.","category":"interpretation","label":"F0 faithful","evidence":"My team focused on the users applying for refunds first","narrative":"The source also states: “We achieved this by splitting our fortnightly sprints in two: testing, researching and accepting applications in the first week and then suspending submissions to concentrate on testing, researching and processing applications the second.”","narrativeRelation":"supports","origin":"none","explanation":"This is a supported synthesis of the team’s stated initial user focus and its scheduled research and testing work; it does not claim those choices caused launch or results.","materiality":"Summarizes the article’s central approach without adding a causal claim."}]}

